          "author": "Benedict Atkins",
          "note": "Marketplace",
          "description": "These short stories based on children in the Bible were written by the bedside of my little boy as I helped him feel safe enough to sleep — and they worked!\n\nInspired by what we know from Scripture; with good theology; and playful yet prayerful imagination to fill in some blanks, these stories are designed to soothe and inspire your little ones and, hey, maybe even you too.",
